0,Nupe people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nupe_people,The Nupe (traditionally called the Nufawa by the Hausas and Tapa by the neighbouring Yoruba) are an ethnic group native to North Central Nigeria. They are the dominant ethnic group in Niger State and an important minority in Kwara State.,Nupe-Nupe-Tako,Niger-Congo
