3,Nupe language,https://grokipedia.com/page/Nupe_language,"The Nupe language, also known as Nupe-Nupe-Tako, is a Niger-Congo language of the Nupoid subgroup within the Volta-Niger branch, primarily spoken by the Nupe people in the central region of Nigeria.",Nupe-Nupe-Tako,Niger-Congo
